# graphify knowledge-graph build artifacts (graph.json/html, cache, cost, temp
# files). Regenerated locally via /graphify and graphify's post-commit hook, so
# they are not tracked (a committed 3MB graph.json would churn on every commit).
# The .graphifyignore build-config IS tracked so every local build shares it.
graphify-out/
.claude/settings.local.json
